gle_visibility('help');return false;\" id=\"helplink\">help</a>\n<div id=\"help\">\n\n<p>\nClick anywhere on a node (with \"cell\" cursor) to outline a node and all of its subtrees.\n</p>\n<p>\nClick on a name (with \"crosshair\" cursor) to highlight every occurrence of a name.\n(Note that all the name nodes are the same node, so those also all outline together).\n</p>\n<p>\nClick on a file, line, or column (with \"crosshair\" cursor) to highlight positions\nin that file, at that file:line, or at that file:line:column, respectively.<br>Inlined\nlocations are not treated as a single location, but as a sequence of locations that\ncan be independently highlighted.\n</p>\n<p>\nClick on a `" } scope_id = 0 type_origin = "inferred" type_ref = object { kind = "string" type_origin = "inferred" } value = object { literal_kind = "string" text = "`\n<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"toggle_visibility('help');return false;\" id=\"helplink\">help</a>\n<div id=\"help\">\n\n<p>\nClick anywhere on a node (with \"cell\" cursor) to outline a node and all of its subtrees.\n</p>\n<p>\nClick on a name (with \"crosshair\" cursor) to highlight every occurrence of a name.\n(Note that all the name nodes are the same node, so those also all outline together).\n</p>\n<p>\nClick on a file, line, or column (with \"crosshair\" cursor) to highlight positions\nin that file, at that file:line, or at that file:line:column, respectively.<br>Inlined\nlocations are not treated as a single location, but as a sequence of locations that\ncan be independently highlighted.\n</p>\n<p>\nClick on a `" } } id = 188 semantic_facets = list [ "UASF_0224" ] source_span = object { end_column = 2 end_line = 140 end_offset = 3662 file = "C:\\PROGRA~1\\Go\\src\\cmd\\compile\\internal\\noder\\html.go" start_column = 1 start_line = 138 start_offset = 3558 } structural_kind = "LiteralExpr" } object { fields = object { id = 189 kind = "identifier" name = "ir.DownArrow" operation = object { semantics = object { confidence = "exact" }